                        <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Hospital awareness helps people understand the &#xa;healthcare servises available to them and how a&#xa;hospital supports patient well-being. By sharing clear&#xa;and useful information about medical facilities,&#xa;doctor, and quality of care, the hospital builds trust&#xa;within the community. when people are aware of their&#xa;health options, they can make better decisions and&#xa;feel more conident seeking care when needed.&#xa;Hospital awareness also strengthens the connection&#xa;between the hospital and the community it serves.&#xa;"/>
